        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Due to the nature of our technology and the rapid technological changes that characterize the markets we operate in, we believe that trade secrets and other unpatented know-how relied upon in connection with the development of new products and the enhancement of existing products are generally more important than patent protection in establishing and maintaining a competitive advantage.",
        "start_character": 35179,
        "end_character": 35568
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-015637",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-015637-0e7f3543f0e58c3d",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-015637",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Nevertheless, we continually review our development efforts to assess the existence and patentability of new intellectual property.",
        "start_character": 35569,
        "end_character": 35700
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-015637",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-015637-0e7f3543f0e58c3d",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-015637",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Over time, we have produced improvements to a number of activities in order to drive meaningful impact at scale and reflect our member-centric design approach and commitment to exceptional experiences, including:",
        "start_character": 15414,
        "end_character": 15626
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-015637",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-015637-0e7f3543f0e58c3d",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-015637",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Several states in which we operate also have adopted similar fraud and abuse laws as described above.",
        "start_character": 44209,
        "end_character": 44310
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-015637",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-015637-0e7f3543f0e58c3d",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-015637",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Smart Recommendations: We have developed our own machine learning algorithms, informed by member interaction data and our content libraries, to power a recommendation engine that surfaces relevant wellness content and resources our clinical teams believe are most relevant to a member’s specific circumstances.",
        "start_character": 16839,
        "end_character": 17149
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-015637",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-015637-0e7f3543f0e58c3d",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-015637",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We aim to provide a differentiated employee value proposition in the market, enabling us to attract and retain high-performing talent.",
        "start_character": 37599,
        "end_character": 37733
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-015637",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-015637-0e7f3543f0e58c3d",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-015637",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We collaborate to develop tailored, multi-channel enrollment outreach programs spanning email, traditional mail, company communications, and workplace collateral that encourage individuals to enroll in an Omada program.",
        "start_character": 26766,
        "end_character": 26985
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-015637",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-015637-0e7f3543f0e58c3d",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-015637",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We do not manufacture, reprocess, repackage, remanufacture, import, export, or act as a specification developer for the medical devices we provide to members, nor have we sought or obtained 510(k) clearance, PMA approval, or other marketing authorizations for the connected devices provided in connection with our programs.",
        "start_character": 55028,
        "end_character": 55351
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-015637",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-015637-0e7f3543f0e58c3d",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-015637",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We sell our programs directly to customers and through channel partners.",
        "start_character": 31924,
        "end_character": 31996
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-015637",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-015637-0e7f3543f0e58c3d",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-015637",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We sell our programs to customers that cover the cost for covered individuals, either by contracting with us directly or by arranging access through entities that we call “channel partners,” which resell our programs to their own end customers.",
        "start_character": 1606,
        "end_character": 1850
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-015637",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-015637-0e7f3543f0e58c3d",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-015637",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-06",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We work to develop trust with each member and use technology to help us personalize their experience, enabling us to unlock results at scale.",
        "start_character": 1212,
        "end_character": 1353
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-015637",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-015637-0e7f3543f0e58c3d",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-015637",
